   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://github.com/gaocegege/Processing.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/gaocegege/Processing.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343503945000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MHWGemxYsnCZpMw2TdBCJ\">Processing.R</a> is the R mode for Processing, and it uses renjin to interpret  R code in JVM. Now the new mode is available in Processing:<div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-2TSWI2nvCQk/WZZlX-jVToI/AAAAAAAAAHw/2K3ohEjmTosTJKWcpN_Pi9g0SKpFxeMjQCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E6%258D%2595%25E8%258E%25B7.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-2TSWI2nvCQk/WZZlX-jVToI/AAAAAAAAAHw/2K3ohEjmTosTJKWcpN_Pi9g0SKpFxeMjQCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E6%25258D%252595%2525E8%25258E%2525B7.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343503945000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pBIOnRubEZHgl5_64X5rq\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-2TSWI2nvCQk/WZZlX-jVToI/AAAAAAAAAHw/2K3ohEjmTosTJKWcpN_Pi9g0SKpFxeMjQCLcBGAs/s400/%25E6%258D%2595%25E8%258E%25B7.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"251\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div>Welcome to have a try :)</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
